Scope

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the desktop app in
app/ and the packaging around it.

Two components this project builds on are not covered by it, because they are
not mine to relicense:

  * The linuwu_sense kernel driver, fetched at build time and bundled into the
    .deb. GPL-2.0, as a derivative of the in-tree acer-wmi driver. The changes
    in patches/ are GPL-2.0 for the same reason.

  * The Python hardware service in service/, GPL-3.0.

Both keep their own licences and their own copyright notices. Using this
project is unaffected; redistributing those components means following their
terms, not this one.
